{title: O Happy Day}
{artist: Philip Doddridge}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 92}

Verse 1
O [Bb]happy day that [Eb]fixed my [Bb]choice on thee, my Savior [F]and my God!
Well [Bb]may this glowing [Eb]heart re[Bb]joice, and tell its [F]raptures [Bb]all abroad.

Chorus
Happy [F]day, happy [Bb]day, when [Eb]Jesus [Bb]washed my [F]sins a[Bb]way!
He taught me how to [F]watch and pray, and live re[Bb]joicing [F]every [Bb]day.
